    "text": "If <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are the slopes of the tangents to the ellipse <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> which passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>5,4</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
